        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/58956e/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-11-04T14:52:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hey all,</p>\n<p>I know that the demos in Indy are big this weekend and there will be a large attendance for those (wish I could be there) but I was kind of hoping we could get some cross-pollination going here. So I wanted to let everyone know that there is a local game convention call Rock-Con happening in Rockford, Il this weekend starting on Friday and going until Sunday.</p>\n<p>While there I will be trying to solicit people to play in the open gaming area (sadly I didn’t think ahead to include it in my demo of another game). If your in the area and would like to attend check out the con <a href=\"http://www.rock-con.com\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">here</a>.</p>\n<p>I love this game and hope that I can generate a lot of interest in it this weekend.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:34:55.577Z",
