        "raw": "Hey all,\n\nI know that the demos in Indy are big this weekend and there will be a large attendance for those (wish I could be there) but I was kind of hoping we could get some cross-pollination going here. So I wanted to let everyone know that there is a local game convention call Rock-Con happening in Rockford, Il this weekend starting on Friday and going until Sunday.\n\nWhile there I will be trying to solicit people to play in the open gaming area (sadly I didn't think ahead to include it in my demo of another game). If your in the area and would like to attend check out the con [url=http://www.rock-con.com]here[/url].\n\nI love this game and hope that I can generate a lot of interest in it this weekend.",
